'''Bats''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by killing two trapped innocents as the clown in [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Halloween_Event_2020#Part_2 Scary Mode] during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It uses the same design as the [[Default Knife]] in the exception of the bats imprinted on the blade, hence the name, and the silver guard.

